The best interval we can use (the interval whose points are given that's closest to $x=9$) is the interval between $x=7$ and $x=10$. Let's find the average rate of change between those points.

$\begin{align}
f'(9)&\approx\dfrac{f(10)-f(7)}{10-7}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{-99-(-89)}{3}
\\\\
&\approx-3.33
\end{align}$
